hadiths[17]{hadithnumber,text}:
"550","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se apne walid se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab ghulam do ke darmiyan ho aur un mein se ek apna hissa aazad kare; agar woh maal dar ho to us par aala qeemat lagai jae aur woh aazad ho [mukammal].' Sufyan kehte hain: Aur kabhi Amr bin Dinar kehte: Qeemat na kami wali na zyadati wali."
"551","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo apna hissa ghulam mein aazad kare, jabke us ke paas maal ho jo ghulam ki qeemat tak pahunche, us par adl ki qeemat lagai jae; woh apne shareekon ko un ke hisse de, ghulam us par aazad ho. Warna us par utna aazad hua jitna us ne aazad kiya.'"
"552","[AI-translation] Umar bin Hakam [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, beshak meri ek bandi meri bakriyan charati thi; main us ke paas aaya jabke bakriyon mein se ek bakri ghayab thi; main ne us se us ke bare mein poocha; us ne kaha: Use bhediya kha gaya. To mujhe us par afsos hua; main Bani Adam mein se ek aadmi tha [aam insan jo ghussa hota hai]; main ne us ke chehre par thappad mara. Mujh par [nazr] gardan aazad karna hai; kya main use aazad karun? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us [bandi] se farmaya: 'Allah kahan hai?' Us ne kaha: Aasman mein. Aap ne farmaya: 'Main kaun hun?' Us ne kaha: Aap Rasulullah Sallallahu alaihi wasallam hain. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Use aazad karo.' To Umar bin Hakam ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, cheezen jo ham Jahiliyat mein karte the: Ham kahinon ke paas jate the. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Kahinon ke paas na jao.' To Umar ne kaha: Ham [parindon se] bura shagun lete the. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Yeh sirf woh hai jo tum mein se koi apne nafs mein pata hai; to tumhen [apne kamon se] na roke.' Abu Ja'far kehte hain: Main ne Muzani ko kehte suna: Shafi'i (Rahimahullah) ne farmaya: Malik bin Anas is aadmi ka naam Umar bin Hakam rakhte hain; jabke woh Mu'awiyah bin Hakam hain. Abu Ja'far kehte hain: Woh jaisa Shafi'i (Rahimahullah) ne farmaya. Abu Ja'far kehte hain: Malik is hadees ki sanad mein Hilal bin Usamah kehte hain; jabke woh Hilal bin Ali hain. Magar ek kehne wale ne kaha: Woh Hilal bin Ali bin Usamah hain; agar aisa hai to Malik ne unhen un ke dada ki taraf mansoob farmaya."
"553","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Hudaibiyah wale saal Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath oont saat [aadmiyon] ki taraf se, gae saat [aadmiyon] ki taraf se zibah ki."
"554","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jundub bin Abdullah Bajali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Eid mein hazri di; Aap ko maloom hua ke logon ne namaz se pehle zibah kiya. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Tum mein se jis ne namaz se pehle zibah kiya woh apna zabiha dohrae; jis ne nahin zibah kiya woh Allah ke naam par zibah kare.'"
"555","[AI-translation] Bushair bin Yasar (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke Abu Burdah bin Niyar ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zibah karne se pehle yomul Azha mein zibah kiya; un ka gumaan hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen dusri qurbani ke sath wapas aane ka hukm diya. Abu Burdah ne kaha: Mujhe jaza ke siwa nahin milta; to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Agar tumhen jaza ke siwa na mile to use zibah karo.'"
"556","[AI-translation] Abbad bin Tamim (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke Uwaimir bin Ashqar ne yomul Azha [Eid ki namaz ke liye] nikalne se pehle apni qurbani zibah ki; unhon ne is ka zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kiya. To Aap ne unhen dusri qurbani ke sath wapas aane ka hukm diya."
"557","[AI-translation] Abbad bin Tamim (Rahimahullah) se Uwaimir bin Ashqar se riwayat hai ke unhon ne nikalne se pehle zibah kiya; unhon ne is ka zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se Aap ke [namaz se] phirne ke ba'd kiya. To un ka gumaan hai ke Aap ne unhen qurbani ke sath wapas aane ka hukm diya."
"558","[AI-translation] Hazrat Bara bin Azib (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) yomun-Nahr khutba dete khade hue; Aap ne Allah ki hamd aur sana bayan ki, phir farmaya: 'Tum mein se koi namaz padhe baghair zibah na kare.' Ravi kehte hain: To mere mamun khade hue aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, aaj ka din woh hai jis mein gosht ki khwahish hoti hai; main ne apni qurbani zibah ki aur apne ghar walon aur padosiyon ko khilaya. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: 'Tum ne [waqt se pehle] kar liya; dusra zibah dohrao.' Unhon ne kaha: Mere paas doodh wali bakri ka bachcha [anaq laban] hai jo gosht ki do bakriyon se behtar hai. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Woh tumhari dono qurbaniyon mein se behtareen hai; jaza tumhare ba'd kisi ke liye kafi nahin hoga.' Shafi'i kehte hain: Abdul-Wahhab ne kaha: Mera khayal hai woh bakri [ma'iz] thi. Abu Ja'far kehte hain: Main ne Muzani ko kehte suna: Shafi'i (Rahimahullah) ne farmaya: Anaq bakri [ma'iz] hai jaisa Abdul-Wahhab ne kaha; bhed ke mada ke liye rakhl kaha jata hai. Aap ka farman: Woh tumhari dono qurbaniyon mein se behtareen hai: Tum ne dono ko zibah kiya un se do qurbaniyon ki niyyat karte hue; jab tum ne pehli ko zibah ke waqt se pehle muqaddam farmaya to dusri hi qurbani hai, pehli qurbani nahin agarche tum ne us se qurbani ki niyyat ki. Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka farman: 'Tumhare ba'd kisi ke liye kafi nahin hoga' is par dalalat karta hai ke woh us ke liye khaas thi. Aap ka farman: Doodh wali bakri ka bachcha yani woh bachcha jo doodh ke liye pala jae na zibah ke liye."
"559","[AI-translation] Urwah bin Abi Al-Ja'd Bariqi (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen deenar diya ke us se Aap ke liye bakri ya qurbani khareeden. Ravi kehte hain: Main ne us se Aap ke liye do bakriyan khareedin aur un mein se ek deenar mein bech di. Ravi kehte hain: Main Aap ke paas bakri aur deenar laya. Ravi kehte hain: 'To Aap ne mere liye bae mein barkat ki dua farmai.' Woh aise the ke agar mitti khareedte to us mein nafa pate."
"560","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne do seeng wale chitkabre [safed-siyah] mendhe qurban farmaye."
"561","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) do seeng wale [mendhe] qurban farmate. Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain: Main bhi do seeng wale [mendhe] qurban karta hun."
"562","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Abi Yahya, Aslamiyon ke aazad karda ghulam ki walida (Rahimahallah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Umm Bilal bint Hilal ne apne walid se khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Bhed ka jaza qurbani mein kafi hai.' Abu Ja'far kehte hain: Muzani ne ham ko aise hi apne bete se padh kar sunaya; jabke woh apne walid se hai."
"563","[AI-translation] Abu Ya'fur Abdi (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Ibn Abi Aufa ke paas aaya aur un se tiddi khane ke bare mein poocha. To unhon ne kaha: 'Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath chhe ya saat ghazwat mein shirkat ki; ham tiddi khate the.'"
"564","[AI-translation] Salman bin Amir [Raziyallahu anhu] se apne chacha se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Bachche ke sath us ka aqiqah hai; us ki taraf se khoon [qurbani] bahao aur us se gandagi [baal mund kar] door karo.'"
"565","[AI-translation] Umm Kurz [Raziyallahu anha] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aayi; main ne Aap ko farmate suna: 'Ladke ki taraf se do barabar bakriyan, ladki ki taraf se ek bakri.'"
"566","[AI-translation] Umm Kurz [Raziyallahu anha] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aayi Aap se hadi ke goshton ke bare mein poochne; main ne Aap ko farmate suna: 'Ladke ki taraf se do bakriyan, ladki ki taraf se ek bakri; tumhen nuqsan nahin ke woh nar hon ya mada [aqiqah ke janwar].'"
